733e198e61ef9a6eada07c5a3fa42a66.mp4?t=1694611386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiverse Madness</h2>Jump into our chaotic multiverse and brawl your way across reality: from the peaceful quiet of the Urban Battleground, to the Asteroid Colony that\u2019s out of this world. Whether you want to play as a pirate in the deep reaches of space, a soldier in the belly of a pirate ship, or a dwarf in a quaint English town, we\u2019ve got you covered! We\u2019re bringing more modes, more maps, and more troopers into this crazy mix all of the time.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124940/extras/aae58f446d727bf6ee93770978ec93c8.poster.avif?t=1694611386\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124940/extras/aae58f446d727bf6ee93770978ec93c8.webm?t=1694611386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124940/extras/aae58f446d727bf6ee93770978ec93c8.mp4?t=1694611386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player-Focused Design</h2>We\u2019re committed to ensuring Super Squad is fun for everyone, regardless of their decision to spend money on the game. That means a whole host of content to unlock and earn, more gamemodes, maps, and Troopers regularly released, and our ongoing support for competitive play.","developers":["Bad Fox Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1124940/header.jpg?t=1694611386","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<s